speechtext:
It seems to me that, since so much doubt has been cast upon this clause;

Criminal Code
since we are dealing with the freedom of people, and so many proper and valid objections have been raised, this might very well be left over for one more year so that it might be given serious study. We cannot be trifling with a few words which we may insert and which may be interpreted quite differently from the way in which the minister interprets them here. I am just throwing out that suggestion.
